ttps://github.com/gon1zau6jyun4liu5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gon1zau6jyun4liu5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-28T01:03:09Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T01:03:09Z","body":"# Issue Report: Reliability of Rule Adherence (Ref #13852)\n\nI am also experiencing this issue.\n\n### Description\nI have defined a strict set of user rules in `.gemini/GEMINI.md`, specifically mandating explicit language constraints (e.g., \"Always use Korean\"). Despite these rules being marked as \"MUST ALWAYS FOLLOW\", the agent occasionally ignores them and reverts to English, particularly when generating structured artifacts.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n1. Define a strict rule in `.gemini/GEMINI.md` (e.g., Language = Korean).\n2. Perform complex coding tasks or request file generation.\n3. Observe that the agent sometimes outputs content in English, bypassing the explicit system instruction.\n\n### Expected Behavior\nThe agent should treat `.gemini/GEMINI.md` rules as hard constraints that override internal probabilistic biases.\n\n### Actual Behavior\nThe agent occasionally treats strict rules as suggestions, leading to reliability issues in professional workflows.\n\n### Environment\n- **OS**: macOS\n- **Agent Context**: User Rules defined in custom markdown file injected into system prompt.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google-gemini/gemini-cli/issues/comments/3694345002/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google-gemini/gemini-cli/issues/comments/3823993434","html_url":"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/issues/13852#issuecomment-3823993434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google-gemini/gemini-cli/issues/13852","id":3823993434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOObWEYM7j7YJa","user":{"login":"linuxtextadventurer","id":26860236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODYwMjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26860236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer","html_url":"https://github.com/linuxtextadventurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxtextadventurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T14:14:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T14:14:18Z","body":"<img width=\"1262\" height=\"445\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/337661ed-f295-4348-a276-4038e780c836\" />\n\nSort of annoying.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"htt